{title: Yesterday Once More}
{artist: Carpenters}
{key: C}
{tempo: 112}

{c: C 调新手编配（C-Em-Am-F-Dm-G）；速度与和弦请对照原曲核对}

{start_of_verse: 主歌一}
[C]When I was young
[Em]I'd listen to the radio
[Am]Waiting for my favorite songs
[Am7]When they played I'd sing along
[F]It made me smile
[G]Those were such happy times
[C]And not so long ago
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 主歌二}
[C]How I wondered where they'd gone
[Em]But they're back again
[Am]Just like a long lost friend [Am7]
[F]All the songs I loved so well [G] [C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: 副歌}
[F]Every Sha-la-la-la
[G]Every Wo-o-wo-o
[Em]Still shines [Am]
[F]Every shing-a-ling-a-ling
[G]That they're starting to sing's
[C]So fine [Am]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 尾声}
[F] [G]
[C]
{end_of_verse}
